Buttons Clickable actions in contextual color variants, three sizes, and outline, ink, ghost, ring, and icon looks, with built-in loading and disabled states. Filled primary and status chrome uses contrast-aware on-fill ink (--vd-text-on-primary / --vd-text-on-status): bright hues keep dark labels in light and dark. Button VariantsButton SizesButton States Press is the live :active state — hold it down. Ghost ButtonsInk Buttons A fat single outline on the border box — not the detached .vd-btn-ring halo, and not the 1px .vd-btn-outline stroke that fills primary on hover. Rest is transparent; hover fills black with a white label in light, and solid primary with on-fill ink in dark. Use it as variant="ink" or .vd-btn-ink on a link styled as a button. Ring Buttons A detached outer ring for the one action you want read first on a screen that already uses solid buttons everywhere. It is a modifier, not a variant — add .vd-btn-ring to whatever button you already have. The gap is transparent, so it keeps working on cards, glass and imagery. Icon ButtonsLoading StateClass Reference UsageClassesClassDescriptionType.vd-btnBase button class — required on all buttonsBase.vd-btn-primaryPrimary action colorVariant.vd-btn-secondarySecondary/neutral action colorVariant.vd-btn-successSuccess/positive action colorVariant.vd-btn-warningWarning/caution action colorVariant.vd-btn-dangerDanger/destructive action color — unified status name (matches Vue variant="danger")Variant.vd-btn-errorRetained backward-compatible alias for .vd-btn-dangerVariant.vd-btn-infoInformational action colorVariant.vd-btn-outlineOutlined button (neutral border)Variant.vd-btn-outline-primaryOutlined button with primary colorVariant.vd-btn-outline-secondaryOutlined button with secondary colorVariant.vd-btn-inkFat single 2px outline (not the ring). Hover fills black in light. On this docs site in dark, hover fills solid primary with dark ink. Also VdButton variant="ink".Variant.vd-btn-smSmall button sizeSize.vd-btn-lgLarge button sizeSize.vd-btn-blockFull-width block buttonSize.vd-btn-ghostTransparent background with hover tintVariant.vd-btn-ghost-primary … .vd-btn-ghost-subtleGhost with color-tinted hover statesVariant.vd-btn-iconCircular icon-only buttonModifier.vd-btn-ringDetached outer ring with a transparent gap — layers on any variant and size. Suppressed inside .vd-btn-group. Tune with --vd-btn-ring-width / -gap / -colorModifier.is-loadingLoading state — blanks the label and shows a spinner (prefer a .vd-btn-spinner child, matching VdButton; legacy ::after alone is fine for outline/ghost)State (class).vd-btn-spinnerReal spinner element used by VdButton :loading — suppresses the legacy ::after and keeps solid-variant colours correctState (child).vd-btn-fullAlias of .vd-btn-block — full-width (display: block)SizedisabledDisables interaction and dims buttonState (attr)Component API (Vue 3)Prop / eventDescription:variantprimary | secondary | success | warning | danger | info, or "ghost" / "ink" (default "primary").:sizesm | md | lg (default "md").:loadingShows a spinner and blocks clicks (adds .is-loading and a .vd-btn-spinner child; label is blanked).:disabledDisables the button.:ringDraws a detached outer ring around the button (adds .vd-btn-ring). Layers on any variant and size; default false.:typebutton | submit | reset (default "button").@clickEmitted on click (suppressed while disabled or loading).(outline / ghost-colour / icon)CSS-only classes (.vd-btn-outline, .vd-btn-ghost-primary…, .vd-btn-icon) that ship in vd3's CSS — not wrapped as VdButton props.
Class | Description | Type
.vd-btn | Base button class — required on all buttons | Base
.vd-btn-primary | Primary action color | Variant
.vd-btn-secondary | Secondary/neutral action color | Variant
.vd-btn-success | Success/positive action color | Variant
.vd-btn-warning | Warning/caution action color | Variant
.vd-btn-danger | Danger/destructive action color — unified status name (matches Vue variant="danger") | Variant
.vd-btn-error | Retained backward-compatible alias for .vd-btn-danger | Variant
.vd-btn-info | Informational action color | Variant
.vd-btn-outline | Outlined button (neutral border) | Variant
.vd-btn-outline-primary | Outlined button with primary color | Variant
.vd-btn-outline-secondary | Outlined button with secondary color | Variant
.vd-btn-ink | Fat single 2px outline (not the ring). Hover fills black in light. On this docs site in dark, hover fills solid primary with dark ink. Also VdButton variant="ink". | Variant
.vd-btn-sm | Small button size | Size
.vd-btn-lg | Large button size | Size
.vd-btn-block | Full-width block button | Size
.vd-btn-ghost | Transparent background with hover tint | Variant
.vd-btn-ghost-primary … .vd-btn-ghost-subtle | Ghost with color-tinted hover states | Variant
.vd-btn-icon | Circular icon-only button | Modifier
.vd-btn-ring | Detached outer ring with a transparent gap — layers on any variant and size. Suppressed inside .vd-btn-group. Tune with --vd-btn-ring-width / -gap / -color | Modifier
.is-loading | Loading state — blanks the label and shows a spinner (prefer a .vd-btn-spinner child, matching VdButton; legacy ::after alone is fine for outline/ghost) | State (class)
.vd-btn-spinner | Real spinner element used by VdButton :loading — suppresses the legacy ::after and keeps solid-variant colours correct | State (child)
.vd-btn-full | Alias of .vd-btn-block — full-width (display: block) | Size
disabled | Disables interaction and dims button | State (attr)
Prop / event | Description
:variant | primary | secondary | success | warning | danger | info, or "ghost" / "ink" (default "primary").
:size | sm | md | lg (default "md").
:loading | Shows a spinner and blocks clicks (adds .is-loading and a .vd-btn-spinner child; label is blanked).
:disabled | Disables the button.
:ring | Draws a detached outer ring around the button (adds .vd-btn-ring). Layers on any variant and size; default false.
:type | button | submit | reset (default "button").
@click | Emitted on click (suppressed while disabled or loading).
(outline / ghost-colour / icon) | CSS-only classes (.vd-btn-outline, .vd-btn-ghost-primary…, .vd-btn-icon) that ship in vd3's CSS — not wrapped as VdButton props.
